            "sid": "2CH 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa dadkii waddanku soo wateen Yehoo'aaxaas ina Yoosiyaah, oo waxay meeshii aabbihiis boqor ugaga dhigeen Yeruusaalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoo'aaxaas, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yoo'aaxaasna markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray saddex iyo labaatan sannadood, oo intii saddex bilood ah ayuu Yeruusaalem boqor ku ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii Masar Yeruusaalem kaga dejiyey carshigiisii, oo dalkiina wuxuu saaray baad ah boqol talanti oo lacag ah iyo talanti dahab ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa boqorkii Masar wuxuu dalkii Yahuudah iyo Yeruusaalemba boqor uga dhigay walaalkiis Elyaaqiim, oo magiciisiina wuxuu u beddelay Yehooyaaqiim. Oo walaalkiis Yoo'aaxaasna Nekoo wuxuu u kaxaystay dalkii Masar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehooyaaqiim, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yehooyaaqiimna markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray shan iyo labaatan sannadood, oo Yeruusaalemna wuxuu boqor ku ahaa kow iyo toban sannadood, oo isna wuxuu sameeyey wax shar ku ah Rabbiga Ilaahiisa ah hortiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa isagii ku soo kacay Nebukadnesar oo ahaa boqorkii Baabuloon, silsilado buuna ku xidhay oo Baabuloon u kaxaystay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Nebukadnesar weliba wuxuu kaloo Baabuloon u qaatay weelashii guriga Rabbiga, oo wuxuu dhigtay macbudkiisii Baabuloon ku yiil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Yehooyaaqiim falimihiisii kale, iyo karaahiyadiisii uu sameeyey, iyo wixii isaga laga helayba, bal eeg, dhammaantood waxay ku qoran yihiin kitaabkii boqorrada dalka Israa'iil iyo dalka Yahuudah, oo meeshiisiina waxaa boqor ka noqday wiilkiisii Yehooyaakiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehooyaakiin, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yehooyaakiinna markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray siddeed sannadood, oo Yeruusaalem boqor buu ku ahaa saddex bilood iyo toban maalmood, oo isna wuxuu sameeyey wax Rabbiga hortiisa shar ku ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii sannaddii soo wareegtay ayaa Boqor Nebukadnesar soo cid diray, oo wuxuu Baabuloon keenay isagii iyo weelashii wanaagsanaa oo gurigii Rabbiga, oo walaalkiis Sidqiyaahna ayuu boqor uga dhigay dalkii Yahuudah iyo Yeruusaalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sidqiyaah, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sidqiyaahna markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray kow iyo labaatan sannadood, oo Yeruusaalemna wuxuu boqor ku ahaa kow iyo toban sannadood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu sameeyey wax Rabbiga Ilaahiisa ah hortiisa shar ku ah, oo iskuma uu hoosaysiin Nebi Yeremyaah oo afka Rabbiga ku hadlayay hortiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wuxuu ka fallaagoobay Boqor Nebukadnesar oo isaga Ilaah ku dhaariyey, laakiinse wuu madax adkaaday oo qalbigiisana wuu qallafiyey si uusan ugu soo noqon Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba kuwii wadaaddada sarsare ahaa iyo dadkiiba si weyn bay u xadgudbeen oo waxay wada sameeyeen karaahiyadii quruumuhu samayn jireen oo dhan, oo waxay nijaaseeyeen gurigii Rabbiga, ee uu isagu Yeruusaalem quduus kaga dhigay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dumistii Yeruusaalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbiga ah Ilaaha awowayaashood goor wanaagsan ayuu iyagii u soo diray wargeeyayaashiisii, maxaa yeelay, dadkiisa iyo meesha rugtiisa ah ayuu u naxay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse way ku majaajiloodeen Ilaah wargeeyayaashiisii, oo eraygiisiina way quudhsadeen, nebiyadiisiina way fududaysteen, ilaa ay cadhadii Rabbigu ku dhacday dadkiisii oo dawo loo waayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed wuxuu iyagii ku soo kiciyey boqorkii reer Kaldayiin, kaasoo raggoodii dhallinyarada ahaa seef ku laayay iyagoo ku jira gurigii meeshoodii quduuska ahayd, oo isaguna uma uu nixin wiil ama gabadh, ama oday ama cirroole, dhammaantoodna wuu u gacangeliyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weelashii guriga Ilaah oo dhan yar iyo weynba, iyo khasnadihii guriga Rabbiga, iyo khasnadihii boqorka iyo kuwii amiirradiisaba dhammaantood wuxuu geeyey Baabuloon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo gurigii Ilaah waa la gubay, oo derbiyadii Yeruusaalem waa la dumiyey, oo guryaheedii waaweynaa oo dhanna waa la gubay, oo weelasheedii wanaagsanaa oo dhanna waa la wada baabbi'iyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii seefta ka baxsadayna wuxuu u kaxaystay Baabuloon, oo waxay addoommo u ahaan jireen isaga iyo wiilashiisii ilaa la gaadhay boqortooyadii Faaris, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si uu ku rumoobo Eraygii Rabbiga ee ka baxay afkii Yeremyaah, ilaa dalkii ku istareexay sabtiyadiisii, waayo, in alla intii uu baabba'sanaa ayuu sabti dhawrayay, si ay u dhammaadaan toddobaatan sannadood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In Eraygii Rabbiga ee Yeremyaah afkiisa ka soo baxay uu ahaado aawadeed, sannaddii kowaad oo Kuuros oo ahaa boqorkii Faaris ayaa Rabbigu kiciyey ruuxii Kuuros oo ahaa boqorkii Faaris, oo isna boqortooyadiisii oo dhan ayuu ogeysiis ugu dhawaaqay, oo weliba qoray, oo wuxuu yidhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuuros oo ah boqorka Faaris wuxuu leeyahay, Boqortooyooyinka dhulka oo dhan waxaa i siiyey Rabbiga ah Ilaaha samada, oo wuxuu igu amray inaan isaga guri uga dhiso Yeruusaalem oo ku taal dalka Yahuudah. Haddaba ku alla kii idinku dhex jira oo dadkiisa ah Rabbiga Ilaahiisa ahu ha la jiro oo isna ha tago.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
